> +#ifndef _DT_BINDINGS_CLK_EXYNOS5260_H
> +#define _DT_BINDINGS_CLK_EXYNOS5260_H
> +
> +#define	ID_NONE		0

This is not a part of DT binding and should not be defined here. 
Furthermore, the driver should simply use 0 directly.

